      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "COME AND SEE (3) was a head turning 21.92 winner at Ballarat last start. Hot win latest and looks the one to beat again. PAW WHISPER (1) was quickly out of the boxes with a slick early sectional clocking 22.34 with a 4.5 lengths win at this track over 390m. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings six times from 12 attempts. Must be included in calculations. PAW PRYDI (2) missed the frame last time when sixth (24.36) at Bendigo but prior to that had two placings in a row. Form at the trip sound including four wins. One of the main contenders. HARA HACHI BU (8) placed last time (23.38) at Horsham in a Mix 3/4, finishing third and beaten 4.5 lengths. Has already won two times from this draw.",
